---
/**
 * FIG. 01 — Now.
 *
 * The page opens on Wasif as a point cloud (CloudStage.astro), built from a real
 * photo of him, with a detector's box around him. This is the text beside it:
 * the name, one line, and where he is now. Every line is from the resume.
 */
---

<div class="now">
  <h1 class="now__name">Wasif Karim</h1>
  <p class="now__line">Software engineer building production services, AI features and robots.</p>
  <p class="now__meta label">AI Research Engineer · OpsiClear · Cleveland, OH</p>
</div>

<style>
  .now {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-s);
  }

  .now__name {
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 2rem + 7vw, 7.5rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
  }

  .now__line {
    max-width: 30ch;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
  }

  .now__meta {
    color: var(--ink-60);
  }
</style>
